  info: The flight controller is the brain of the drone. It reads the sensors (gyro
    and accelerometer) and tells the ESC how fast each motor should spin, many times
    every second. Most FPV drones run Betaflight on it.
  whereItGoes: In the middle of the drone, above the ESC, with its arrow pointing
    to the front.
